  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>remimazolam</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N05CD14</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>two compartments, IV dosing <small>(PK_2C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Chen J et al. 2025</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>critically ill patients</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>remimazolam</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_remimazolam/Remimazolam_Chen2025_median_by_1_000_bootstraps\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL (L/h)</td><td>58.7</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>V1 (L)</td><td>25.2</td><td>L</td><td><small>V1</small></td></tr><tr><td>Q (L/h)</td><td>21.9</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>Q</small></td></tr><tr><td>V2 (L)</td><td>37.5</td><td>L</td><td><small>V2</small></td></tr></table><h4>About remimazolam</h4><p>Remimazolam is a benzodiazepine sedative used to produce conscious sedation during medical procedures. It is approved and authorised in the European Union, though it remains a relatively new agent rather than a widely established one.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7311799\">Wikidata Q7311799</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Remimazolam\">Remimazolam</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Chen J et al. (2025). Population pharmacokinetic analysis of remimazolam after continuous infusion for sedation in critically ill patients. <i>Frontiers in pharmacology 16:1526266</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3389/fphar.2025.1526266\">10.3389/fphar.2025.1526266</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40703354\">40703354</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Chen_2025: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
